abstract: "Public, aggregate, and reproducible methodological materials for validating a structured transcription, contextual resolution, normalization, QA, and human validation pipeline applied to handwritten school registration records from 1910-1915. Identifiable records, exact addresses, coordinates, archival images, and row-level discrepancies are not included."
